('Kyowa KW-3820 Air Fryer', 'kyowa-kw-3820-air-fryer', 'Kyowa''s 4-liter air fryer adds a digital display and preset cooking programs over the Hanabishi analog formula — the step-up for Filipino families who want digital control and multiple cooking modes without crossing the ₱2,000 price barrier.', '/images/products/kyowa-kw-3820-air-fryer.webp', 'Kyowa KW-3820 Air Fryer', 'https://down-ph.img.susercontent.com/file/ph-11134207-7r98v-lrds5cu73cvp5c', now()),
