('JBL Clip 4 Waterproof Bluetooth Speaker', 'jbl-clip-4-waterproof-bluetooth-speaker', 'The best waterproof clip speaker for Filipino travelers and beach-goers — JBL Clip 4''s IP67 waterproofing, integrated carabiner clip, and compact pocketable size make it the most practical outdoor companion for Philippine island hopping and beach trips.', '/images/products/jbl-clip-4-waterproof-bluetooth-speaker.webp', 'JBL Clip 4 Waterproof Bluetooth Speaker', 'https://down-ph.img.susercontent.com/file/ph-11134207-7r992-lw6m58x0s9ac3b', now()),
