('Ecovacs Deebot N8', 'ecovacs-deebot-n8', 'The best choice for homes with complex layouts, lots of furniture, or families with children who leave things on the floor.', '/images/products/ecovacs-deebot-n8.webp', 'Ecovacs Deebot N8', 'https://site-static.ecovacs.com/upload/us/image/product/2023/07/18/070507_1733-DEEBOT-N8BLACK-1280x1280.jpg', now()),
('Grohe Tempesta 100 Rain Shower Head', 'grohe-tempesta-100-rain-shower-head', 'The best overall shower head for the Philippines — Grohe Tempesta 100 delivers the genuine luxury rain shower experience with German engineering quality, SpeedClean anti-limescale silicone nozzles (critical for Philippine hard water), and a spray pattern broad enough to transform the Filipino morning shower.', '/images/products/grohe-tempesta-100-rain-shower-head.webp', 'Grohe Tempesta 100 Rain Shower Head', 'https://snoopy.archdaily.com/images/archdaily/catalog/uploads/photo/image/276530/tempesta-26411000-b.jpg?width=320', now()),
