('Canon PIXMA G3020', 'canon-pixma-g3020', 'The best student pick for color-heavy projects, photo-heavy reports, and families that want wireless refillable-ink printing with Canon color output.', '/images/products/canon-pixma-g3020.webp', 'Canon PIXMA G3020', 'https://www.ryans.com/storage/products/main/canon-pixma-g3020-wi-fi-multifunction-color-11686818704.webp', now()),
