('Hansgrohe Croma 100 4-Jet Shower Head', 'hansgrohe-croma-100-4-jet-shower-head', 'The best premium rainfall shower head for Filipino bathroom renovations — Hansgrohe Croma 100''s 4-jet spray modes, QuickClean anti-limescale technology, and German premium quality deliver the hotel-bathroom shower experience for the discerning Filipino homeowner.', '/images/products/hansgrohe-croma-100-4-jet-shower-head.webp', 'Hansgrohe Croma 100 4-Jet Shower Head', 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I3bb-OxrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg', now()),
