('Xiaomi Redmi Buds 4 Lite', 'xiaomi-redmi-buds-4-lite', 'The best wireless earbuds for Xiaomi ecosystem users under ₱1,200 — Xiaomi Redmi Buds 4 Lite integrates with Mi Fitness and Xiaomi phones for seamless connectivity, with solid audio tuning and Xiaomi''s trusted brand reliability.', '/images/products/xiaomi-redmi-buds-4-lite.webp', 'Xiaomi Redmi Buds 4 Lite', 'https://www.innovapointperu.com/cdn/shop/files/gsc_124455968_3987140_1.jpg?v=1695068517', now()),
