('Hanabishi HRAF-28S 3L Air Fryer', 'hanabishi-hraf-28s-3l-air-fryer', 'The best 3L Philippine local brand air fryer for families of 2–3 — Hanabishi''s HRAF-28S brings a larger 3L basket and better temperature control than 2L budget alternatives at a price that serves as the mid-range local brand option for Filipino households upgrading from basic cooking methods.', '/images/products/hanabishi-hraf-28s-3l-air-fryer.webp', 'Hanabishi HRAF-28S 3L Air Fryer', 'https://down-ph.img.susercontent.com/file/ph-11134207-7r98p-lskqvi34hu5x09', now())
